@startuml F7.5-D04-carregar-versao-anterior
title F7.5-D04 — Carregar versão anterior
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CTController" as Ctrl
participant "GetRevisionUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: clica versão 1
WebApp -> Jwt: GET .../revisoes/1
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT revisão
Postgres --> UC: ARCHIVED
UC --> WebApp: 200
note right of WebApp
  banner somente leitura;
  Salvar desabilitado
end note
WebApp --> Admin: editor readonly

@enduml
